WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,300
Get me up! Quick!

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:05,300
All the food is for you!

3
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:07,300
You should believe me first!

4
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:16,740
Stuttering

5
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:29,620
My life is in it

6
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:31,120
The server also crashed

7
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:33,120
No one will go online to call for help from now on

8
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:37,430
I have to carry it all myself.

9
00:00:37,430 --> 00:00:40,430
This is the transit warehouse I rented half a month ago

10
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:42,750
Trucks come here every day

11
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:44,750
There will be mountains of supplies! Grab them!
